    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mn>1011</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>1011</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>1011</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msub><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>1011</mn></mmultiscripts><mn>1</mn></msub><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>1011</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8230;</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>q</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>So, here&nbsp;the remainder will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p>",
